@projectApiUrl = http://localhost:3002/api

# ── 1. Preparar: crear un proyecto y ticket de tipo support ──────────────────

### 1a. Crear proyecto (ajusta el projectId si ya tienes uno)
# @name createProject
POST {{projectApiUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cliente ABC",
  "key": "ABC",
  "businessUnit": "Soporte",
  "description": "Proyecto en produccion con soporte activo",
  "status": "production",
  "priority": "high"
}

### 1b. Crear ticket de tipo support
# @name createTicket
POST {{projectApiUrl}}/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Error en módulo de facturación",
  "description": "El cliente reporta que las facturas no se generan correctamente.",
  "type": "support",
  "priority": "urgent",
  "status": "todo"
}

# ── 2. Verificar auto-creación del support detail ─────────────────────────────

### 2. GET support-detail (debe existir con isBillable: true, resto null)
GET {{projectApiUrl}}/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/support-detail

# ── 3. Actualizar con información de cobro ────────────────────────────────────

### 3. PATCH: completar datos de soporte y valorización
PATCH {{projectApiUrl}}/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/support-detail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientContact": "Juan Pérez",
  "ufValue": 2.5,
  "isBillable": true,
  "slaDeadline": "2026-07-01T18:00:00.000Z",
  "notes": "Soporte urgente fuera de horario, se aplica tarifa especial"
}

### 4. GET para verificar actualización
GET {{projectApiUrl}}/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/support-detail

### 5. PATCH: marcar como cobrado
PATCH {{projectApiUrl}}/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/support-detail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billedAt": "2026-06-26",
  "invoiceRef": "FAC-2026-0042",
  "resolvedAt": "2026-06-26T15:30:00.000Z"
}

# ── 4. Casos de error ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6. Intentar crear support-detail en un ticket que NO es tipo support
#    Primero crea un ticket normal y luego intenta hacer POST en su support-detail
# @name createNormalTicket
POST {{projectApiUrl}}/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ticket de tarea normal",
  "type": "task",
  "priority": "medium",
  "status": "todo"
}

### 7. Debe retornar 400 Bad Request (not of type 'support')
POST {{projectApiUrl}}/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}/tickets/{{createNormalTicket.response.body.$.id}}/support-detail
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. Debe retornar 409 Conflict (ya existe support-detail para este ticket)
POST {{projectApiUrl}}/projects/{{createProject.response.body.$.id}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/support-detail
Content-Type: application/json

{}
